5. Fair play and lawful, good-faith use
   You may not use the Software or any Modification:
   a) for anything illegal in Your jurisdiction or in the jurisdiction of those affected;
   b) in bad faith: to deceive or defraud, to impersonate the author or others, to misrepresent the
      origin of the Software, or to remove or hide the credits;
   c) for unethical use in gaming, including (without limitation): cheating; bots or automation
      that play, act or give inputs in a game on a player's behalf; reading or altering game memory,
      network traffic or files to gain an advantage; exploiting bugs to break the rules of a match;
      rank manipulation (boosting, smurfing services, win-trading, account selling); and any use
      that breaks the terms of service, code of conduct or tournament rules of the game, its
      publisher or the platform where it is played;
   d) to harass, threaten, stalk or expose other players, or to collect or publish their personal
      data;
   e) in violation of Microsoft's Game Content Usage Rules or the rights of any third party.
   The Software is meant to help people learn and enjoy the game: advice a human reads or hears
   and decides on by themselves.

6. Termination
   Any breach of this license ends Your rights under it automatically. Rights may be restored only
